# Translate commands that are rarely understood correctly after (->)
# Comments after #

# Here is the explanation of internal variables like {space} {delspace} and {->}...
# {space}: to insert a space
# {delspace}: do not write a space, or remove the last space
# {->}: this creates (->) itself.

# \n: new line
# {nopuncture}: do not write punctuation marks

# general
convert to(->){->}{nopuncture}
stared(->)start
starts(->)start
state(->)start
starter(->)start

